		{
			"id":"647da5d80119b365",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"CODE\n```cpp\nvoid Mahony::observe(const math::Vec3f& acc) {\n    acc_ = acc;\n    acc_.normalize();     // only fetch direction\n    acc_age_ = 0.0f;      // acc_age_唯一清零口\n}\n```",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-3670,
			"y":-2560,
			"width":500,
			"height":240
		},
